{"name":"-54-T-2","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreen","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreen","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"529","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":true,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Carriage F01 (First-Class Carriage), Intercontinental Railway train \"Future\"."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_footsteps_woodfloor","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"m_avg_labyrinth","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tareus follows Lyudmila's voice to the first-class carriage. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The disgusting insects have infested this place and the scent of blood has given rise to a nauseating stench."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"Stop_AVG_loop","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"Woman","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eve... My Eve..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Tareus","expression":1,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Tareus","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eve..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The woman she just saw in the dining carriage is sitting on the ground, howling inconsolably."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Woman","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Please, save my daughter! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Vory took her... They said they'd only let he go if I paid 1,000 ounces of Sardis Gold... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But I don't have that kind of money!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Passenger","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The only sound in the silent carriage is her weeping, but nobody pays her any attention. Everyone seems to have simultaneously decide